  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EOM Jordan 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is the implementation of logistics, security, financial and administrative aspects of the 2024 EU EOM to Jordan, for the General Elections, scheduled for the 10th of September 2024. IOM will select of team of experts (Project Manager, Logistics Expert, Security Expert, IT Expert, Finance &amp; Contract Expert, three Liaison Officers) who will be deployed to Amman from mid July to early October 2024 to implement the mission. The EOM will be composed by a Chief Observer, a Core Team of 11 members, 28 Long Term Observers and 38 Short Term Observers. IOM will have no visibility in the project.</narrative>
  </description>
